{"id":"ff306e0cc6f0a65e","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-threshchar.md","title":"Asummability characterization of threshold functions","display":"thm-threshchar — Asummability characterization of threshold functions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-threshchar","aliases":["27-thm-threshchar"],"display":"thm-threshchar — Asummability characterization of threshold functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-threshold]]","[[27-df-kasummable]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.3 Theorem 9.14","source_printed_pages":"414–415","source_pdf_pages":"438–439","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-convex-separation-argument-read"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-threshchar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-threshchar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-threshchar — Asummability characterization of threshold functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3dcef588a10bf884\" href=\"?note=3dcef588a10bf884\" title=\"27-df-kasummable\">27-df-kasummable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.3 Theorem 9.14"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"414–415"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"438–439"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-convex-separation-argument-read"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Asummable}_n,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Asummable}_n,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3dcef588a10bf884\" href=\"?note=3dcef588a10bf884\" title=\"27-df-kasummable\">27-df-kasummable</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Threshold}_n=\\mathrm{Asummable}_n=\\bigcap_{k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge2}}\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Threshold}_n=\\mathrm{Asummable}_n=\\bigcap_{k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge2}}\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §9.3，Theorem 9.14，印刷 pp.414–415／PDF pp.438–439；已核对陈述与证明。有限非阈值函数的真假凸包相交；有理凸组合清除分母后产生允许重复的等长真、假点等和见证。若见证长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，真、假点会相同而矛盾，故长度至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>阈值到 asummable 方向将真假点的分离不等式求和即得矛盾。常函数直接可分离，不需要对空集使用凸包相交论证。有限阶条件不能代替对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq2\">\\(k\\geq2\\)</span> 的量化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-kasummable","status":"resolved","id":"3dcef588a10bf884","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-kasummable]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 与 $\\mathrm{Asummable}_n,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]、[[27-df-kasummable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-kasummable","status":"resolved","id":"3dcef588a10bf884","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 与 $\\mathrm{Asummable}_n,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]、[[27-df-kasummable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Threshold}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Asummable}_n,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Threshold}_n=\\mathrm{Asummable}_n=\\bigcap_{k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge2}}\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq2","display":false}],"bytes":1588,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-571","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-threshchar|thm-threshchar — Asummability characterization of threshold functions]]"},{"id":"18fe7220421a34b0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$、$\\mathrm{Chow}$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]、[[27-df-chow]]；asummability 表征见 [[27-thm-threshchar]]。"}],"outgoing":["d0db491e5f6359f5","3dcef588a10bf884"]}